COPY public.course (name, description, about, learnings, tags, thumbnail_image, thumbnail_video, public, published, open_to_contributors, id, thumbnail_type, org_id, course_uuid, creation_date, update_date, seo, extra_metadata) FROM stdin;
Writing Clearly at Work	Shorter messages, fewer meetings, less confusion.	Most of what goes wrong at Riverbend goes wrong in writing: a request nobody understood, an update that buried the important part, a message that read as blunt when it was only rushed. This course is about the small habits that fix that.	Write requests people can act on; structure an update; give feedback that lands; know when writing is the wrong tool.	communication,writing,collaboration	73eedcbc-10d9-52d9-8a5a-c67be990756e_thumbnail.webp		t	t	f	20	IMAGE	2	course_336cd9c7-cf17-460f-b500-8474a2a6ad19	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.265284	null	null
Customer Support Fundamentals	Handling the conversation when something has gone wrong.	Support at Riverbend is not a script. Customers arrive mid-problem, often annoyed, usually missing information. This course covers how to take the heat out of a conversation, work out what is actually wrong, and know when to stop and hand it on.	Triage an incoming issue; write a reply that resolves rather than deflects; handle an angry customer; know exactly when to escalate.	support,customers,service	9621cabf-d4ed-53d5-a0d5-60b9e5979fea_thumbnail.webp		t	t	f	21	IMAGE	2	course_24f83958-4561-4cd5-a388-5318442304f8	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.311848	null	null
Your First Two Weeks	What to read, who to meet, and what nobody will think to tell you.	New starters lose their first fortnight to questions they feel silly asking. This course answers them up front: how the week is shaped, who owns what, where things are written down, and how to ask for help without feeling like a nuisance.	Find your way around Riverbend; know who to ask; run a useful first one-to-one; set up your tools properly.	onboarding,new starter,basics	ae60cffc-55a2-5ffc-81a2-915f666468f1_thumbnail.webp		t	t	f	19	IMAGE	2	course_e2c79aec-e66c-4637-b789-6934282e0135	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.166832	null	null
Knowing What We Sell	The catalogue, the pricing, and the questions customers actually ask.	You cannot help a customer choose between two products you do not understand. This course covers how the Riverbend catalogue is organised, how pricing and lead times really work, and the handful of questions that come up in almost every conversation.	Navigate the catalogue; explain pricing and lead times accurately; answer the five most common customer questions; know what you are not allowed to promise.	product,catalogue,pricing	6c4d38f8-efac-5643-8ba6-3f83367d66c7_thumbnail.webp		t	t	f	22	IMAGE	2	course_efedfe1f-9fb1-4973-8fbe-b45694fda229	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.351142	null	null
Working with Numbers	Reading a report without being misled by it.	Most people at Riverbend read numbers every week and were never taught how. This course is not statistics — it is the practical business of knowing what a figure covers, what it leaves out, and when a chart is quietly telling you something untrue.	Read a report critically; spot the common ways numbers mislead; ask the right question about an average; present a figure honestly.	data,reporting,analysis	c31c420c-59ac-505b-bf9a-1d57b9e34d9a_thumbnail.webp		t	t	f	23	IMAGE	2	course_60e7b54d-28d4-4a33-8ce4-482a2431d8dd	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.391708	null	null
Compliance Essentials	The rules that are not optional, and why they exist.	Compliance training has a reputation for being a box to tick. This one is written to be read: what the obligations actually are at Riverbend, what happens when they are missed, and what to do in the specific moments where people usually get it wrong.	Handle customer data correctly; recognise and report a breach; understand the approval thresholds; know what to do when asked to bend a rule.	compliance,data protection,policy	be65518e-7cae-528d-9a7c-9f08181422e0_thumbnail.webp		f	t	f	24	IMAGE	2	course_df75f789-d935-44f9-a439-865bde8c5e34	2026-07-18 10:00:00	2026-10-01 23:52:50.432073	null	null
\.


