et-btn,.planet-btn .orb{transition:none}.radar-sweep{animation:none}}\n\n\n#scene,#sampleLayer,#moonLayer,#atlasLayer{overflow:hidden}#sampleLayer{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:6;pointer-events:none}#sampleLayer button{pointer-events:auto}\n.boarding-mode .nav,.boarding-mode .mission,.boarding-mode .contextbar,.boarding-mode .scene-tools{pointer-events:none;opacity:.45}\n.planet-btn:focus-visible{outline:none}.planet-btn:focus-visible .orb{outline:2px solid var(--mint);outline-offset:5px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body class="no-start">\n<div id="scene" role="img" aria-label="Döndürülebilen üç boyutlu gezegen ve uzay aracı"></div><div id="vignette"></div><div id="scanSweep" hidden><div class="radar-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>\n<div class="cockpit" id="cockpit" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><linearGradient id="metal" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#152737"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#040a11"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#223849"/></linearGradient></defs><path class="frame-outer" d="M0 0H1440V40L1395 72H1040L1005 58H435L400 72H45L0 40Z" fill="url(#metal)" opacity=".85"/><path d="M0 900H1440V860L1320 831H970L930 812H510L470 831H120L0 860Z" fill="url(#metal)" opacity=".78"/><path d="M0 155 18 177 22 688 0 716M1440 155 1422 177 1418 688 1440 716" fill="url(#metal)"/><path d="M40 68H400L435 54H1005L1040 68H1400M118 830H470L510 811H930L970 830H1322" fill="none" stroke="#8cebc5" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="1"/></svg><div class="cockpit-left"></div><div class="cockpit-right"></div><div class="pov-label">OXONOM EXPLORER / KOKPİT GÖRÜŞÜ</div><div class="cockpit-status">GÖRÜŞ SİSTEMİ<strong>ORBITAL BAĞLANTI AKTİF</strong>POV · KEŞİF MODU</div></div>\n<div class="boarding" id="boarding" hidden><strong>KOKPİTE GEÇİLİYOR</strong><small>Görüş sistemi başlatılıyor</small><div class="boarding-bars"><i></i></div></div>\n<div class="contextbar" id="contextbar"><button id="sunBtn"><span class="menu-icon">☀</span><span>Güneş</span></button><button id="systemBtn"><span class="menu-icon">◎</span><span>Sistem</span></button><button id="moonsBtn" class="moon-menu"><span class="menu-icon">☾</span><span class="btn-text">Uydular</span></button><button id="aboutBtn"><span class="menu-icon">ⓘ</span><span>Hakkında</span></button></div>\n<div class="flight-status" id="flightStatus">ROTA AYARLANIYOR</div><div id="moonLayer"></div><div id="atlasLayer"></div>\n\n<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="logo" aria-hidden="true"></div><div><div class="brand-name">ORBIT</div><div class="brand-sub">OXONOM · KEŞİF AKADEMİSİ</div></div></div><div class="toolbar"><div class="xp">✦ <b id="xpNum">0</b> XP</div><button class="iconbtn" id="soundBtn" title="Sesi aç" aria-label="Sesi aç"></button><button class="iconbtn" id="logBtn" title="Keşif defteri" aria-label="Keşif defteri"></button><button class="iconbtn" id="settingsBtn" title="Ayarlar ve yardım" aria-label="Ayarlar ve yardım"></button><button class="iconbtn" id="fullBtn" title="Tam ekran" aria-label="Tam ekran"></button></div></header>\n<aside class="mission glass" id="mission" hidden><div class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i><span id="missionCounter">GÖREV 01 / 08</span></div><div class="mission-progress" id="missionProgress"></div><h2 id="missionTitle"></h2><p id="missionClue"></p><div id="steps"><div class="step active" id="step0"><span>1</span>İpucuyla gezegeni bul</div><div class="step" id="step1"><span>2</span>Sinyali tara</div><div class="step" id="step2"><span>3</span>Deneyi tamamla</div></div><button class="primary" id="scanBtn"><span class="scanfill" id="scanfill"></span><span class="radar-dial" aria-hidden="true"><i class="radar-grid"></i><i class="radar-cross"></i><i class="radar-sweep"></i><i class="radar-progress"></i></span><span class="radar-copy"><strong id="scanText">Sinyal radarı</strong><small id="radarPct">HAZIR · BASILI TUT</small></span></button><p id="hint">Alt sıradan bir gezegen seç.</p><div class="scan-actions"><button class="secondary" id="readBtn">◖ Görevi dinle</button><button class="secondary" id="freeBtn">Serbest keşif</button></div></aside>\n<aside class="lab glass" id="lab" hidden></aside>\n<div class="planet-caption"><div class="tag" id="planetTag">03 / GÜNEŞ SİSTEMİ</div><h2 id="planetName">Dünya</h2><p id="planetDesc">Mavi gezegenimiz.<br>Uzaydaki tek evimiz.</p><div class="datum"><div><small>ÇAP</small><b id="planetDiameter">12.742 km</b></div><div><small>BİR YIL</small><b id="planetYear">365 gün</b></div></div><div class="caption-bottom"><i class="dot"></i><span id="planetType">KAYASAL GEZEGEN</span></div><p class="caption-note">Gezegen boyutları ve uzaklıklar bu sahnede ölçekli değildir. Görünüm hızları oyun için ayarlanmıştır.</p></div>\n<div class="scene-tools"><button class="iconbtn" id="zoomIn" title="Yakınlaş" aria-label="Yakınlaş"></button><button class="iconbtn" id="zoomOut" title="Uzaklaş" aria-label="Uzaklaş"></button><button class="iconbtn" id="resetCamera" title="Görüşü sıfırla" aria-label="Görüşü sıfırla"></button></div><div class="camera-hint">Sürükle ve gezegeni keşfet<span>DOKUN · DÖNDÜR · YAKINLAŞ</span></div><div class="level-flag" id="levelFlag">KAŞİF RÜTBESİ / ÇAYLAK</div>\n<nav class="nav glass" aria-label="Gezegen seçimi"><div class="nav-head"><span>UÇUŞ ROTASI</span><span>GÜNEŞ’TEN DIŞARI →</span></div><div class="planets" id="planetNav"></div></nav>\n<div id="sampleLayer"></div><div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>\n<section class="overlay intro" id="intro"><div class="intro-content"><div class="eyebrow"><i class="dot"></i>KÜÇÜK KAŞİFLER. BÜYÜK KEŞİFLER.</div><h1>Evren seni<em>bekliyor.</em></h1><p>Araştırma robotumuz Piko’nun sinyalleri kayboldu. Uzay aracına atla, gezegenleri keşfet ve sinyalleri geri getir!</p><div class="startmode" aria-label="Oyun modu"><button class="chosen" data-mode="junior">6–8 yaş · Yardımlı</button><button data-mode="explorer">9+ yaş · Kaşif</button></div><button class="primary" id="startBtn">Maceraya başla <span>↗</span></button><div class="intro-details"><span><b>8 gezegen</b>Keşfedilecek bir evren</span><span><b>8 görev</b>Deneyerek öğren</span><span><b>Süre baskısı yok</b>Kendi hızında oyna</span></div><div class="intro-footer">Telefon, tablet ve bilgisayarda oynanır. İnternet gerekmez. İlerlemen bu cihazda otomatik kaydedilir.<button id="introAbout" class="secondary" style="display:block;margin-top:16px;font-size:10px;min-height:32px;padding:8px 12px;color:#9fc0b8">Oxonom · Oyun hakkında ↗</button></div></div></section>\n<div class="overlay" id="modalOverlay" hidden><section class="modal" id="modalContent" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle" tabindex="-1"></section></div>\n<div class="boot" id="boot"><div class="logo"></div><h2>ORBIT</h2><p id="bootMsg">Uzay aracı hazırlanıyor…</p><div class="loading-bar" id="loadingBar"></div></div>\n<!-- Three.js r160.1 (MIT). Copyright © 2010–2024 three.js authors. The MIT license is included at the end of this file. -->\n<script>console.warn('Scripts "build/three.js" and "build/three.min.js" are deprecated with r150+, and will be removed with r160. Please use ES Modules or alternatives: https://threejs.org/docs/index.html#manual/en/introduction/Installation'),\n/**\n * @license\n * Copyright 2010-2023 Three.js Authors\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n */\nfunction(t,e){"object"==typeof exports&&"undefined"!=typeof module?e(exports):"function"==typeof define&&define.amd?define(["exports"],e):e((t="undefined"!=typeof globalThis?globalThis:t||self).THREE={})}(this,(function(t){"use strict";const e="160",n=1,i=2,r=3,s=0,a=1,o=100,l=204,c=205,h=0,u=1,d=2,p=0,m=1,f=2,g=3,_=4,v=5,x=6,y="attached",M="detached",S=300,b=301,T=302,E=303,w=304,A=306,R=1e3,C=1001,L=1002,P=1003,I=1004,U=1005,D=1006,N=1007,O=1008,F=1009,B=1012,z=1013,G=1014,H=1015,V=1016,k=1017,W=1018,X=1020,j=1023,q=1026,Y=1027,Z=1029,J=1031,K=1033,$=33776,Q=33777,tt=33778,et=33779,nt=35840,it=35841